<title>NEW ZEALAND: Hallenstein yr net profit eases 4.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Hallenstein yr net profit eases 4.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Aug 1</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   12.49 vs 13.14</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   12.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   21.5 vs 22.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     156.5 vs 154.7</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 18.6 vs 19.5</p>
<p>    Tax					6.1 vs 6.4</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	58 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date December 12</p>
<p>Reg date December 6</p>
<p>Ex div   December 9</p>
<p>Note - Hallenstein Glasson Holdings Ltd is a clothes retailer. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
